<Multi_key> <asciicircum> <asciicircum> <I> : "ᴵ"  # MODIFIER LETTER CAPITAL I
<Multi_key> <asciicircum> <asciicircum> <J> : "ᴶ"  # MODIFIER LETTER CAPITAL J
<Multi_key> <asciicircum> <asciicircum> <K> : "ᴷ"  # MODIFIER LETTER CAPITAL K
